stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Generating
    Generating --> NeedsReview: valid structured output
    Generating --> GenerationFailed: provider/parse failure
    GenerationFailed --> Generating: retry or fallback
    NeedsReview --> NeedsReview: edit / partial regenerate
    NeedsReview --> ValidationBlocked: unsupported claim or unsafe diagram
    ValidationBlocked --> NeedsReview: resolve issue
    NeedsReview --> Approved: explicit approval + gates pass
    NeedsReview --> Rejected: reviewer rejects
    Approved --> NeedsReview: edit creates new revision
    Approved --> Exported: export artifact
    Exported --> Published: manually record publication
    Rejected --> Archived
    Published --> [*]
    Archived --> [*]
